IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-CALDERA-SVD.

DATA DIVISION.
01 ROWS-M              PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 COLS-N              PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 RANK-R              PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 COMPRESSION-PCT     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-CALDERA-SVD.
    IF ROWS-M == 0 OR COLS-N == 0 OR RANK-R == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE ROWS-M TO COMPRESSION-PCT.
    MULTIPLY COLS-N BY COMPRESSION-PCT.
    MULTIPLY 100 BY COMPRESSION-PCT.
    MOVE ROWS-M TO RANK-R.
    ADD COLS-N TO RANK-R.
    MULTIPLY 8 BY RANK-R.
    DIVIDE RANK-R INTO COMPRESSION-PCT.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 COMPRESSION-PCT.
    WEIGHT 30 RANK-R.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
